     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts CdaPQToQuantityConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"CdaPQToQuantityConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"hcCdaPQToQuantityConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-PQ.html\">PQ: PhysicalQuantity (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Quantity\">Quantity</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-PQ.html#s-PQ.value\">PQ.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Quantity#s-Quantity.value\">Quantity.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>PQ.value alimente directement Quantity.value.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-PQ.html#s-PQ.unit\">PQ.unit</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Quantity#s-Quantity.code\">Quantity.code</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>PQ.unit (UCUM) alimente Quantity.code.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"opacity: 0.5\">\"</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Quantity#s-Quantity.unit\">Quantity.unit</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>PQ.unit peut être réutilisé comme libellé d’unité dans Quantity.unit selon la stratégie d’affichage.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"opacity: 0.5\">\"</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Quantity#s-Quantity.system\">Quantity.system</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Si PQ.unit est UCUM, Quantity.system est fixé à http://unitsofmeasure.org.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap CdaPQToQuantityConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"en-CdaPQToQuantityConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcCdaPQToQuantityConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-PQ.html\">PQ: PhysicalQuantity (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Quantity\">Quantity</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-PQ.html#s-PQ.value\">PQ.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Quantity#s-Quantity.value\">Quantity.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>PQ.value alimente directement Quantity.value.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-PQ.html#s-PQ.unit\">PQ.unit</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relat